# Photo Viewer — agent defaults

Read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root for project map, guardrails, and doc index.

## Deploy and updates

When the user asks to **release**, **publish**, **ship**, **bump version**, **deploy**, or **verify updates**:

1. Read **`.cursor/skills/build-and-deploy/SKILL.md`** and follow it.
2. Follow **`docs/DEPLOY_AND_UPDATES.md`** end-to-end (do not skip API verification).
3. Use **`./scripts/bump-version.sh`** when the version is not already bumped; then **`./scripts/release.sh`**.
3. GitHub releases go to **`engineeritdevelopment-hk/photo-viewer-app`** (public). Use `gh` as that account.
4. Every release must upload **`Photo-Viewer-<version>-mac.zip`** containing **`Photo Viewer.app`**.
5. In-app update code lives under **`PhotoViewer/Services/Update/`**; repo slug is **`INFOPLIST_KEY_PhotoViewerGitHubRepository`** in `project.yml`.

## Build

- XcodeGen: edit `project.yml` → `xcodegen generate` → `xcodebuild`.
- Never commit **`build/`** or user data under `~/Library/Application Support/photo_viewer/`.